# demo2_car_one_agent/ is committed: it is what one agent run actually left
# behind, so an attendee without a Claude subscription reads the same files,
# the same record and the same report that are quoted on the slides. The
# notebook skips a stage whose stamp is already there, so nothing is paid for
# twice. Delete the folder to run the demo yourself from scratch.
demo2_car_one_agent/__pycache__/

# These two the notebook writes on demand: demo 1 costs a second and no agent,
# demo 3 is the multi-agent run.
demo1_car_no_agents/
demo3_car_multi_agent/
